  "_doc": "Aubrey's SLP's Gestalt Language Processing starter phrases (session 15, 2026-10-29), as a Phrases folder on Small words. Each run is one of her eight groups: Commenting, Help, Transitions, Protests, Shared Joy, Action Routines, Sensory Motor, New Situations. She draws a phrase with a picture the board already has (*new* for \"This is new\"), so `imageOf` borrows existing art and no tile is generated. It's time for / We gotta go / is the best are carrier phrases: the child adds the word (bath, swing, music) and the sentence engine joins them. I love it was already on Social.",
